{"verses":[{"verse":1,"text":"Mpeni \\nd Bwana\\nd*, enyi mashujaa,"},{"verse":2,"text":"Mpeni \\nd Bwana\\nd* utukufu unaostahili jina lake;"},{"verse":3,"text":"Sauti ya \\nd Bwana\\nd* iko juu ya maji;"},{"verse":4,"text":"Sauti ya \\nd Bwana\\nd* ina nguvu;"},{"verse":5,"text":"Sauti ya \\nd Bwana\\nd* huvunja mierezi;"},{"verse":6,"text":"Hufanya Lebanoni irukaruke kama ndama,"},{"verse":7,"text":"Sauti ya \\nd Bwana\\nd* hupiga kwa miali"},{"verse":8,"text":"Sauti ya \\nd Bwana\\nd* hutikisa jangwa;"},{"verse":9,"text":"Sauti ya \\nd Bwana\\nd* huzalisha ayala,"},{"verse":10,"text":"\\nd Bwana\\nd* huketi akiwa ametawazwa juu ya gharika;"},{"verse":11,"text":"\\nd Bwana\\nd* huwapa watu wake nguvu;"}]}